<title>IRAN: IRAN GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>IRAN GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRAN GOVERNMENT LIST (970804)</p>
<p> **************************************************************</p>
<p> * 4 Aug 97 - Mohammad Khatami was sworn in as President and  *</p>
<p> *		will be working on a new cabinet, which he must *</p>
<p> *		name by August 18.					*</p>
<p> **************************************************************</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>President (Sworn in 4 Aug 97)..Mohammad KHATAMI</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>OUTGOING GOVERNMENT:</p>
<p>First Vice-President and Government</p>
<p>Spokesman..........Hassan HABIBI</p>
<p>Vice-President..Mohammad HASHEMI</p>
<p>(In charge of Executive Affairs)</p>
<p>Vice-President..............Ataollah MOHAJERANI</p>
<p>(In charge of Parliamentary &amp; Legal Affairs)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Formed 16 August 1993):</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>Agriculture.......Issa KALANTARI</p>
<p>Commerce..........Yahya AL-ESHAQ</p>
<p>Construction Jihad.........Gholamreza FOROUZESH</p>
<p>Cooperatives...Gholamreza SHAFEI</p>
<p>Culture &amp; Islamic Guidance.....Mostafa MIRSALIM</p>
<p>Defence &amp; Armed Forces Logistics..........Mohammad FOROUZANDEH</p>
<p>Economy &amp; Finance..........Morteza MOHAMMADKHAN</p>
<p>Education....Mohammad Ali NAJAFI</p>
<p>Energy.....Bijan Namdar ZANGANEH</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs..............Ali Akbar VELAYATI</p>
<p>Health...........Alireza MARANDI</p>
<p>Higher Education.............Mohammad Reza HASHEMI GOLPAYEGANI</p>
<p>Housing &amp; Urban Development.Abbas Ahmad AKHUNDI</p>
<p>Industry...............Mohammad Reza NEMATZADEH</p>
<p>Intelligence (Internal Security).Ali FALLAHIYAN</p>
<p>Interior..Ali Mohammad BESHARATI</p>
<p>Justice........Esmail SHOUSHTARI</p>
<p>Labour &amp; Social Affairs..........Hossein KAMALI</p>
<p>Mines &amp; Metals........Mohammad Hossein MAHLOUJI</p>
<p>Oil.........Gholamreza AGHAZADEH</p>
<p>Post &amp; Telecommunication.......Mohammad GHARAZI</p>
<p>Roads &amp; Transport...Akbar TORKAN</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>OTHER KEY OFFICIALS:</p>
<p>Supreme Leader of the Islamic</p>
<p>    Republic.............Ayatollah Ali KHAMENEI</p>
<p>	   (Succeeded Ayatollah Ruhollah Khomeini on Aug 6 1989)</p>
<p>Head of Judiciary...............Mohammad YAZDI</p>
<p>Speaker of Parliament (Majlis)...........Ali Akbar NATEQ-NOURI</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor........Mohsen NOURBAKHSH</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		7968.</p>
<p>			   (End Government List)</p>
</text>
